<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4;">

{# Rendered once so the VML (Outlook) and non-VML branches share one msgid. #}
{% set cta_label %}{% trans %}Preview and sign the document{% endtrans %}{% endset %}

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #f4f4f4;">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding: 24px 12px;">

<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width: 600px; width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">
<tr>
<td style="padding: 32px;">

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
{% trans inviter_name=inviter_name, inviter_email=inviter_email, document_name=document_name %}
You have been invited by {{ inviter_name }} &lt;{{ inviter_email }}&gt;,
to digitally sign a document named "{{ document_name }}".
{% endtrans %}
</p>

{% if text != "" %}

<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
{% trans inviter_name=inviter_name %}
Message from {{ inviter_name }}:
{% endtrans %}
</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 16px; background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 6px; white-space: pre-wrap;">{{ text }}</p>

{% endif %}

<p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0;">
{% trans %}
Follow the button below to preview and sign the document:
{% endtrans %}
</p>

{# Bulletproof call-to-action button. #}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="margin: 0 auto 24px auto;">
<tr>
<td align="center" bgcolor="#1c7430" style="border-radius: 6px;">
<!--[if mso]>
<v:roundrect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" href="{{ invited_link }}" style="height:52px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:340px;" arcsize="12%" strokecolor="#1c7430" fillcolor="#1c7430">
<w:anchorlock/>
<center style="color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">{{ cta_label }}</center>
</v:roundrect>
<![endif]-->
<!--[if !mso]><!-- -->
<a href="{{ invited_link }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 15px 32px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; background-color: #1c7430;">
<span style="font-size: 20px;">&#9997;&#65039;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;{{ cta_label }}
</a>
<!--<![endif]-->
</td>
</tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #666666;">
{% trans %}
If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:
{% endtrans %}
<br>
<a href="{{ invited_link }}" style="color: #1c7430; word-break: break-all;">{{ invited_link }}</a>
</p>

{# Rendered once so the VML (Outlook) and non-VML branches share one msgid. #}
{% set eduid_label %}{% trans %}Create a free eduID{% endtrans %}{% endset %}

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
{% trans %}
Log in with your account linked to your affiliated organisation. If you have created an eduID without being connected to an affiliated organisation, choose 'eduID Sweden' as the organisation. If you do not have an eduID, you can create one for free:
{% endtrans%}
</p>

{# Secondary call-to-action: create an eduID. Outlined so it stays subordinate to the sign button above. #}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="margin: 0 auto 16px auto;">
<tr>
<td align="center" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-radius: 6px; border: 2px solid #1c7430;">
<!--[if mso]>
<v:roundrect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" href="https://eduid.se/" style="height:44px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:280px;" arcsize="14%" strokecolor="#1c7430" fillcolor="#ffffff">
<w:anchorlock/>
<center style="color:#1c7430;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;">{{ eduid_label }}</center>
</v:roundrect>
<![endif]-->
<!--[if !mso]><!-- -->
<a href="https://eduid.se/" style="display: inline-block; padding: 11px 26px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1; color: #1c7430; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; background-color: #ffffff;">
<span style="font-size: 18px;">&#10133;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;{{ eduid_label }}
</a>
<!--<![endif]-->
</td>
</tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #666666;">
{% trans %}
If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:
{% endtrans %}
<br>
<a href="https://eduid.se/" style="color: #1c7430; word-break: break-all;">https://eduid.se/</a>
</p>

{% if al3 %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
{% trans %}
You are invited to sign this document with a "High" assurance level (AL3). Not all systems support AL3/ "High" assurance level. If you encounter issues with this in your system, please ask the sender to re-send the document with a "Medium" or "Low" assurance level.
{% endtrans%}
</p>
{% endif %}

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #666666;">
{% trans %}
If you experience problems with this service contact the local IT-department at the organisation that invited you to sign. If you are unsure how to do that please reach out to the person who invited you.
{% endtrans %}
</p>

<p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #ebebeb; font-size: 13px; color: #999999;">
{% trans %}
This is an email from eduSign, a service for secure digital signatures, developed by Sunet.
{% endtrans %}
</p>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
